  "question": {
    "text": "A solid having density of $9 \\times 10^{3} \\mathrm{~kg} \\mathrm{~m}^{-3}$ forms face centred cubic crystals of edge length $200 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{pm} .$ What is the molar mass of the solid?\r\n\r\n[Avogadro constant $\\left.\\approx 6 \\times 10^{23} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}, \\pi \\approx 3\\right]$",
    "image": null
